# cave: 0,29,6,0,0x1B
# what: Jashiin phase 2 on foot with a stationary hero (#112 hunt): `jashiin_damage`'s first ~800 frames, then crouch/up/sword bursts in place while he walks to 8 columns and the hero is knocked back.  Walking TOWARD the hero takes two cells on odd poses and AWAY on even ones (MAO2 A529/A550/A583/A5A7); the port had even-only for both.  Clean on fields and pixels (every frame).
